  "rules": [
    "Price revision0 means no human price review; PUT expected_revision0 creates revision1. Price revision independent of ledger revision.",
    "Mapping omission revokes mapping. Adjustment-decision omission leaves shared adjustment unresolved. Only valid human-confirmed mapping enters a product observation.",
    "included_in_line_totals is never allocated again. A separate adjustment with exactly one eligible line is assigned directly (allocation method single_line_scope).",
    "Multi-line or receipt adjustments require independent explicit/proportional price decisions. Purpose allocation is never reused for product pricing.",
    "Explicit allocation must list every in-scope line, including zeros; no out-of-scope or duplicate positions; sums must equal adjustment amount.",
    "Products are immutable identities and may share display names. No fuzzy identity matching. source names and ledger snapshots never change.",
    "Active confirmed ledger only in overview and prices. Voided entries remain retrievable with prior price-review history.",
    "All totals, lowest-price selection and total_count use complete filtered scope before pagination. Ratios sorted by exact arithmetic. display_yuan contains integer or exact numerator / denominator without rounding.",
    "No prices observed response: observations=[],lowest_paid_observation=null,total_count=0. Empty overview numeric sums are0.",
    "Schema migration v2->v3 additive; prior ledger, sessions, drafts, evidence, history preserved."
  ],
